+(defn claude-query-block?
+  "Whether Claude made the Query block `holder` (a db id, or nil): :yes when the marker property is
+  the checkbox it is created as and the block holds true, :no when the block holds anything else,
+  :unknown when there is no holder or the marker property is missing or not that checkbox."
+  [db holder]
